      <title>英特尔取消近半世纪Fellow头衔 顶尖研究员改称杰出工程师</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E8%BF%91%E5%8D%8A%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AAFellow%E5%A4%B4%E8%A1%94-%E9%A1%B6%E5%B0%96%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E5%91%98%E6%94%B9%E7%A7%B0%E6%9D%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%88/</link>
